BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 445.77 Tm (Firsthand Failure Modes, Traps & Economics Checks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 423.55 Tm (The money traps start before the first ride. Black Truck Mick needed $300 a day just to cover costs on the rented SUV,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 408.32 Tm (and admits charging $40 for six riders, a rate they now call too little [uODRGjORQF4 @ 00:10:28]. My Chauffeur Life) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 393.10 Tm (lists the bleed that never shows on a quote: fuel, tolls, detailing, parking and tires, plus a luxury repair that can run into) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 377.87 Tm (the thousands with weeks of downtime [Y-1AudoR8JA @ 00:03:52]. Their countermeasures are a weekly reserve fund,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 362.65 Tm (tracking every single expense, and refusing to buy the cheapest insurance or the cheapest mechanic. TJackk flags the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 347.42 Tm (recurring overhead most beginners forget: the city limo permit renewal runs about $2,000 a year, and holidays go slow) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 332.20 Tm (because the core clients are traveling themselves [o8EUtCEWMzY @ 00:03:41]. TJackk also warns that startup is not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 316.97 Tm (cheap once you stack the SUV, insurance, permits and the car note [Yr0mmM9YyTc @ 00:03:33]. Seasonality) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 301.75 Tm (compounds it, which is why My Chauffeur Life saves a percentage of every job and spreads work across corporate,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 286.52 Tm (tours, weddings and airport runs. Underpricing, thin reserves and seasonal gaps hit together, and every one of these) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 271.30 Tm (operators budgets for all three.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 256.07 Tm (Compliance gaps cost bookings outright. Fares and Frustrations, who has worked multiple markets and states, warns) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 240.85 Tm (that the wrong airport permit or credential means lost bookings [_UpXw8QDal8 @ 00:06:26]. In Jacksonville that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 225.62 Tm (same operator stacked a DBA under an existing LLC's EIN, a local business tax receipt, an airport decal, a business) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 210.40 Tm (bank account and Square tap-to-pay before taking private work. The TCP covers limousines, buses and shuttles, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 195.17 Tm (Business with Mide is blunt that operating in California without the CPUC-issued Transportation Charter Permit is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 179.95 Tm (illegal, while advising operators to compare application services [4TzKcRuyrHY @ 00:00:44]. TJackk got the order) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 164.72 Tm (right in Houston by locking commercial insurance first, then assembling the four documents for the city: limo permit,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 149.50 Tm (commercial insurance, driver license and limo description [o8EUtCEWMzY @ 00:02:36]. The affiliate world carries) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 134.27 Tm (its own risk. Black Truck Mick reports that brokers talk to each other and that F1 week brought nonpayment drama) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 119.05 Tm ([uODRGjORQF4 @ 00:23:22]. Direct clients paid through Zelle, Apple Cash and a business Venmo instead. Permits) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 103.82 Tm (vary by state, as Your Solvent Uncle notes, so the paperwork stack has to be rebuilt for every new market.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 88.60 Tm (The quietest failures happen in the booking and dispatch layer. The Luxury Transportation Academy host says that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 73.37 Tm (running reservations over WhatsApp or text means you lose 'nine times out of 10,' because everything gets lost in the) Tj ET
