BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 477.77 Tm (The most expensive trap Mike_Thebusinessman reports is a hard vehicle cap: HQ Rentals capped the operation at a set) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 462.55 Tm (number of cars, so the team could neither add nor delete vehicles, and staff kept making mistakes on the learning curve,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 447.32 Tm (which forced a full migration to Fleet Finesse [1Va2FwAMf2A @ 00:06:14]. How To Mr flags the same friction from) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 432.10 Tm (the review side: the feature load makes the learning curve steep, small operators renting a handful of units may find it) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 416.87 Tm (overwhelming, and because it is cloud-based, poor connectivity turns straight into frustration [reD8ApAoQBQ @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 401.65 Tm (00:01:24]. Smaller self-inflicted errors bite too. Mike's team uploaded high-quality photos above the 5 megabyte) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 386.42 Tm (guidance and it slowed the booking site's load time, so compress every file before upload [1Va2FwAMf2A @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 371.20 Tm (00:09:22]. Do not expect enterprise support either: most of these vendors are small dev teams, a developer last cost) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 355.97 Tm (Mike almost $70 an hour, a single page can take three to four hours, and new features only ship once enough users ask) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 340.75 Tm (for the same thing, which is why Mike says to lock in launch pricing before it climbs [1Va2FwAMf2A @ 00:24:35].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 325.52 Tm (Fleet Finesse also ships without a rental agreement, so you paste in your own text and drag in fields like customer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 310.30 Tm (name, make, VIN, and start date before the first contract goes out.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 295.07 Tm (Platform dependency is the outside risk nobody controls. Fleet Brothers broke the news that Turo revoked the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 279.85 Tm (whitelisted-IP access to its unofficial API used by CarSync and Fleetwire; Fleetwire's CEO found out the same) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 264.62 Tm (morning as clients and called it kind of the end of CarSync unless it pivots, since CarSync lived on Turo toll invoicing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 249.40 Tm (and change-request automation [VCL-xD3r5VU @ 00:03:30]. Fleet Brothers warn that at 50 cars there are probably a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 234.17 Tm (lot of double bookings without automation, plus copy-pasting pickup instructions for every guest, and hosts running 70) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 218.95 Tm (to 200 cars push hundreds of messages a day that Turo's own automations, lacking variables and conditions, cannot) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 203.72 Tm (match [VCL-xD3r5VU @ 00:05:12]. On payments, Mike_Thebusinessman's trap is the Stripe deposit hold that falls off) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 188.50 Tm (on the seventh day: on a month-long rental the renter can mess up the car after day seven and you no longer have a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 173.27 Tm (security deposit, so long-term rentals get a captured charge or cash [1Va2FwAMf2A @ 00:17:25]. Limo Anywhere) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 158.05 Tm (adds a settlement trap for livery operators: voids only work before your processor batches out the day's transactions, 9) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 142.82 Tm (p.m. in their example, and anything after the batch must go back as a credit instead [8ejH3mv4ka8 @ 00:01:22].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 127.60 Tm (Bluebird frames the silent leak as utilization: a 50-car fleet running at 60 percent utilization is really only running 30) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 112.37 Tm (cars, and the classic 8 a.m. disaster is the one car the system swears is ready sitting out back with a dented door nobody) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 97.15 Tm (logged, while the damage photos sit buried on somebody's phone [1Bh5Wvanfss @ 00:01:34]. The countermeasure) Tj ET
